{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "谁能换实现",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 123.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "谁能换实现，谁就拥有全部资金。",
   "spoken": "谁能换实现，谁就拥有全部资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.59
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "所以升级权限，要按最高等级来保护。",
   "spoken": "所以升级权限，要按最高等级来保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.66,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 5.758,
   "speechEnd": 9.21
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "透明代理的权限，在代理的管理员槽位。UUPS 在实现合约的授权函数里。信标在信标的拥有者手里。",
   "spoken": "透明代理的权限，在代理的管理员槽位。UUPS 在实现合约的授权函数里。信标在信标的拥有者手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.272,
   "dur": 9.672,
   "speechStart": 10.37,
   "speechEnd": 19.105
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "无论在哪，都应该经过多签和时间锁。",
   "spoken": "无论在哪，都应该经过多签和时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.164,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 20.262,
   "speechEnd": 23.166
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "时间锁让升级先排队、再公开，给社区留出复核的时间。",
   "spoken": "时间锁让升级先排队、再公开，给社区留出复核的时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.224,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 24.322,
   "speechEnd": 29.167
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "但时间锁有另一面。",
   "spoken": "但时间锁有另一面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.228,
   "dur": 2.376,
   "speechStart": 30.326,
   "speechEnd": 31.766
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，Compound 第 62 号提案升级了奖励逻辑，里面有错误，部分用户可以超额领取 COMP。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，Compound 第 62 号提案升级了奖励逻辑，里面有错误，部分用户可以超额领取 COMP。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.824,
   "dur": 8.04,
   "speechStart": 32.922,
   "speechEnd": 40.017
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，最坏情况约 28 万枚，约 8000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，最坏情况约 28 万枚，约 8000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 41.084,
   "dur": 5.256,
   "speechStart": 41.182,
   "speechEnd": 45.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "协议没有能停止分发的紧急开关。任何修复，都要走约 7 天的治理流程。",
   "spoken": "协议没有能停止分发的紧急开关。任何修复，都要走约 7 天的治理流程。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.56,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 46.658,
   "speechEnd": 52.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "时间锁挡住了恶意升级，也挡住了紧急修复。",
   "spoken": "时间锁挡住了恶意升级，也挡住了紧急修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 53.668,
   "dur": 4.224,
   "speechStart": 53.766,
   "speechEnd": 57.039
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "所以暂停权和升级权要分开设计：暂停可以快，升级必须慢。",
   "spoken": "所以暂停权和升级权要分开设计：暂停可以快，升级必须慢。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 58.112,
   "dur": 6.528,
   "speechStart": 58.21,
   "speechEnd": 63.817
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "再往下一层，链本身也可能被升级。",
   "spoken": "再往下一层，链本身也可能被升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 64.86,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 64.958,
   "speechEnd": 67.672
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "比如 Mantle。按 L2BEAT 的页面，一个 14 人里 6 人签名的多签，无需延迟就能升级 L1 上的桥和门户合约。",
   "spoken": "比如 Mantle。按 L2BEAT 的页面，一个 14 人里 6 人签名的多签，无需延迟就能升级 L1 上的桥和门户合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 68.728,
   "dur": 10.176,
   "speechStart": 68.826,
   "speechEnd": 78.049
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "部署在 L2 上的协议，安全上限就是这条 L2 的升级权限。",
   "spoken": "部署在 L2 上的协议，安全上限就是这条 L2 的升级权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 79.124,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 79.222,
   "speechEnd": 83.9
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "合约写得再好，资产也可能在 L1 那一端被转走。",
   "spoken": "合约写得再好，资产也可能在 L1 那一端被转走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 84.96,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 85.058,
   "speechEnd": 88.677
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "一次安全的升级，按这个顺序走。",
   "spoken": "一次安全的升级，按这个顺序走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 89.716,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 89.814,
   "speechEnd": 92.254
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "写新实现，只追加变量。用工具比对存储布局。",
   "spoken": "写新实现，只追加变量。用工具比对存储布局。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 93.296,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 93.394,
   "speechEnd": 98.165
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "在主网分叉环境里执行升级，跑全部回归测试。",
   "spoken": "在主网分岔环境里执行升级，跑全部回归测试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 99.228,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 99.326,
   "speechEnd": 103.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "审计新实现，也审计升级交易本身，包括初始化参数。",
   "spoken": "审计新实现，也审计升级交易本身，包括初始化参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 104.272,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 104.37,
   "speechEnd": 108.822
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "通过时间锁排队，公开升级内容。执行以后，立刻跑部署后验证。",
   "spoken": "通过时间锁排队，公开升级内容。执行以后，立刻跑部署后验证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 109.892,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 109.99,
   "speechEnd": 115.44
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "最后，留好回滚方案：新实现有问题时，能不能升级回旧实现？",
   "spoken": "最后，留好回滚方案：新实现有问题时，能不能升级回旧实现？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 116.496,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 116.594,
   "speechEnd": 121.903
  }
